   "new": "The band and the deadline are per product, from that product's days_late; two products can have different deadlines.",
   "source": "Brief B rule 3"
  },
  {
   "old": "Brief A rule 28: first ask 'Can you make this payment today?'.",
   "new": "First ask whether the customer can pay all of them today. If not, go through the products one by one in get_account order, without asking about today again, starting each product at attempt 1.",
   "source": "Brief B rule 4"
  },
  {
   "old": "Brief A rules 18 and 30: persuasion attempts counted for the call's one product.",
   "new": "Persuasion attempts are counted per product.",
   "source": "Brief B rule 5"
  },
